{"gems":{"name":"ceedling","downloads":2116794,"version":"1.1.4","version_created_at":"2026-08-14T00:25:06.569Z","version_downloads":130,"platform":"ruby","authors":"Mark VanderVoord, Michael Karlesky, Greg Williams","info":"Ceedling is a build automation tool for C projects. It is especially adept at building and executing unit test suites — even for tricky embedded systems.\n\nCeedling provides three core functions:\n  [1] It packages up several tools including the C unit test framework Unity, the mock generation tool CMock, and other complementary frameworks and libraries.\n  [2] It simplifies configuration for C toolchains.\n  [3] It automates the running and reporting of test suites as well as release builds.\n\nCeedling projects start with a YAML configuration file. A variety of conventions simplify assembling suites of unit test functions and producing release builds.\n","licenses":["MIT"],"metadata":{"funding_uri":"https://github.com/sponsors/ThrowTheSwitch","homepage_uri":"https://throwtheswitch.org/ceedling","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/ThrowTheSwitch/Ceedling/issues","source_code_uri":"https://github.com/ThrowTheSwitch/Ceedling","mailing_list_uri":"https://throwtheswitch.discourse.group","documentation_uri":"https://throwtheswitch.github.io/Ceedling/"},"yanked":false,"sha":"23cf7a3aa4f0ab473826a29d04794bf7e74c2e3497946fe35c8dee1a6707a910","spec_sha":"43c68b3135fc604febd9f8f1f373a859d9c95167f7a4c12d373e05979b623e8d","project_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/ceedling","gem_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/ceedling-1.1.4.gem","homepage_uri":"https://throwtheswitch.org/ceedling","wiki_uri":null,"documentation_uri":"https://throwtheswitch.github.io/Ceedling/","mailing_list_uri":"https://throwtheswitch.discourse.group","source_code_uri":"https://github.com/ThrowTheSwitch/Ceedling","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/ThrowTheSwitch/Ceedling/issues","changelog_uri":null,"funding_uri":"https://github.com/sponsors/ThrowTheSwitch","dependencies":{"developme